{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1470465-post-2nd-aberrant-war-and-novas","id":1470465,"title":"Post 2nd Aberrant War And Novas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-14T13:22:33-08:00","id":1470465,"title":"Post 2nd Aberrant War And Novas","content":"Another thread got me thinking, what do you think would be the reaction of the world to the end of the 2nd Aberrant War. The potential future timeline makes it clear that both Novas from Eden and Quantikinetics were instrumental in stopping the massive Aberrant invasion. How do you think world nations and more importantly the civilian populace and sway of public thought on that would act. For sure there would still be a lot derision and hate towards anyone with any connection to Quantum from large portions of the population if not the majority of people. But how likely do you think there would be discourse and rethinking of the previous decades once it becomes clear to the world that sane Novas exist? Could there be open trade and negotiations with Eden? It's not uncommon in the real world for major events to reshape how people have looked at historical events. I'd imagine that some groups would even blame governments for keeping Eden a secret when they could have helped fight off the attacking Aberrants. I thought this would be an interesting way to throw some ideas around","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-14T13:56:39-08:00","id":1470469,"title":"","content":"The topic is technically spoilers, so you might want to put it in spoiler tags.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> There's been decades of global propaganda against Aberrants convincing people that all Aberrants are insane monsters. I'd imagine those impressions would take some time and serious effort to thaw. I'd imagine a lot of governments might try to suppress any positive portrayal of Eden's Novas, or even the fact that Novas fought on Earth's side at all. Also, 25 million people die in the 2nd Aberrant war. The public's going to be in the mood for mourning before gratitude. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24366-slarn","name":"Slarn!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24366_2